                <mxCell id="dw_notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Analytics &amp; BI Access Pattern:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Streamlit Dashboard &amp; BI Tools query &lt;b&gt;fact_transportation_stats&lt;/b&gt; directly.&lt;br&gt;• Supports aggregation by &lt;i&gt;Transport Mode&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;Trade Regime&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;Year/Month&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;Weight (Ton)&lt;/i&gt;, and &lt;i&gt;Trade Value (USD)&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• Idempotent upserts on &lt;code&gt;(date, regime, description)&lt;/code&gt; prevent duplicates during Airflow backfills." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF9C3;strokeColor=#FACC15;fontColor=#713F12;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" parent="warehouse_group" vertex="1">
